Hey, even more!

Waiting: A monster appears -- you stop waiting.  You get Hungry --
   you stop waiting.

Picking something up: you can press ":" to look at what's there.

Looting a chest: You can select things just like picking up.

Plus on level 4 (!) I ran into a special level.  I won't give any
details -- I think I've spoiled enough surprises already.

